    <string name="about_mission_label">OUR MISSION</string>
    <string name="about_intro">Voice Yanga is a community-driven platform that empowers citizens to report issues affecting their neighborhoods and connect them with the organizations responsible for resolving them.\n\nMany community problems such as damaged roads, blocked drainage systems, water shortages, illegal dumping, poor sanitation, security concerns, and other public service issues often go unreported or are shared through informal channels where they are easily forgotten. Voice Yanga provides a structured and transparent way to ensure these concerns are recorded, tracked, and acted upon.\n\nOur mission is to make every citizen\'s voice count by creating a bridge between communities and organizations responsible for public services. Through Voice Yanga, citizens can submit reports, attach photos, track the progress of their complaints, and receive updates as issues move from submission to resolution.\n\nVoice Yanga also provides organizations, local authorities, NGOs, and community leaders with tools to manage reports, prioritize urgent issues, monitor trends, and improve response times through a centralized dashboard.</string>
    <string name="about_vision_label">OUR VISION</string>
    <string name="about_vision_statement">To build stronger communities by giving every citizen a simple, transparent, and reliable way to report problems and help create lasting positive change.</string>
    <string name="about_mission_statement">To transform everyday community complaints into actionable information that helps organizations respond faster, make better decisions, and improve the quality of life for everyone.</string>
    <string name="about_what_can_do_label">WHAT YOU CAN DO</string>
    <string name="about_what_can_do_content">• Report community issues with photos and location information.\n\n• Track the status of your reports from submission to resolution.\n\n• Support existing reports to help highlight issues affecting multiple people.\n\n• Receive notifications whenever there is an update on your complaint.\n\n• Help build a cleaner, safer, and more connected community.</string>
    <string name="about_values_label">OUR VALUES</string>
    <string name="about_value_community_title">Community First</string>
    <string name="about_value_community_desc">Every voice matters. We believe communities should have an easy way to be heard.</string>
    <string name="about_value_transparency_title">Transparency</string>
    <string name="about_value_transparency_desc">Users can follow the progress of their reports and stay informed throughout the resolution process.</string>
    <string name="about_value_accountability_title">Accountability</string>
    <string name="about_value_accountability_desc">By keeping records of reported issues and their outcomes, Voice Yanga encourages greater accountability and better service delivery.</string>
    <string name="about_value_innovation_title">Innovation</string>
    <string name="about_value_innovation_desc">We use technology to simplify communication between citizens and organizations while creating meaningful social impact.</string>
    <string name="about_join_label">JOIN US</string>
    <string name="about_join_content">Positive change begins with a single voice.\n\nWhether you\'re reporting a problem, supporting an existing issue, or helping resolve community challenges, you\'re contributing to a better future for everyone.\n\nVoice Yanga — Your Voice. Your Community. Your Impact.</string>
